OL,3,GNEWSAArrests at pro-Palestine protest
OL,4,A'did not breach police guidelines'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe arrests of two women during a
OL,7,Fpro-Palestinian protest in Belfast did
OL,8,Fnot breach police guidelines, an
OL,9,Finvestigation has found.
OL,11,FHowever, the Police Ombudsman raised
OL,12,Fconcerns after officers took no action
OL,13,Fagainst two other women suspected of
OL,14,Fsimilar actions.
OL,16,FSue Pentel, 72, and Martine McCullough,
OL,17,Fwho is in her 50s, were arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of criminal damage following
OL,19,Freports that stickers had been placed
OL,20,Fon a cash machine outside Barclays Bank
OL,21,Fin Castle Place in May 2025.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
