OL,3,GNEWSAArrests at pro-Palestine protest
OL,4,A'did not breach police guidelines'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,7,F(PSNI) also accepted a recommendation
OL,8,Fto improve the performance of a custody
OL,9,Fofficer who recorded identical
OL,10,Finformation about both arrests, despite
OL,11,Fthe circumstances being different.
